X-WR-CALNAME:Strength on GLP-1 — 3 days
X-WR-CALDESC:A free calendar with three 25-minute home strength sessions a 
 week plus a Sunday protein check\, built for adults losing weight on GLP-1
  or other medication. https://honestlittleapps.github.io/calendars/strengt
 h-training-calendar-glp1/
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:P1D
